.SS " None jinja2\&.bccache\&.FileSystemBytecodeCache\&.dump_bytecode ( self, \fBBucket\fP bucket)"

.PP
.nf
Subclasses have to override this method to write the bytecode
from a bucket back to the cache\&.  If it unable to do so it must not
fail silently but raise an exception\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.PP
Reimplemented from \fBjinja2\&.bccache\&.BytecodeCache\fP\&.
.SS " None jinja2\&.bccache\&.FileSystemBytecodeCache\&.load_bytecode ( self, \fBBucket\fP bucket)"

.PP
.nf
Subclasses have to override this method to load bytecode into a
bucket\&.  If they are not able to find code in the cache for the
bucket, it must not do anything\&.

.fi
